  "summary_insights": [
    "Revenue shows significant momentum, with May-26 reaching a peak of £535k, contributing to a YTD total of £1.9m, which is 26.1% ahead of the previous year's performance.",
    "Gross margin has expanded dramatically from 14.5% in late 2025 to 46.6% in the 2026 YTD period, driven by a reduction in subcontractor reliance and better absorption of factory wages.",
    "The business has successfully transitioned from a loss-making position in late 2025 to a net profit of £242k in May-26 alone, resulting in a positive YTD net margin of 9.2%.",
    "Subcontractor costs have been significantly reduced, falling from 47% of turnover in Nov-25 to just 8% in May-26, indicating a successful shift toward internal production efficiency.",
    "Overheads are being managed effectively, decreasing as a percentage of turnover from 75% in Nov-25 to 19% in May-26, demonstrating strong operational leverage as the business scales.",
    "Year-to-date net profit of £23,963 represents a substantial recovery compared to the £169,631 loss recorded in the same period last year.",
    "Marketing and professional fees show high volatility month-on-month, suggesting project-based spending or aggressive growth initiatives during the spring months."
